+Spec refs: REQ-ARC-WMTE-4659,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4659-QD-RANDOM-MUTATION-ABLATION,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4659-VALUE-ROUTING-COST-CONTROL.
+"""
